{"id":"P089-2","subject":"P","unit":"P089","unitTitle":"2025 ② (5월~8월) · 25.07.05 지역난방공사 (한국행동과학연구소)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P089-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.07.05 지역난방공사 (한국행동과학연구소) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n직류 단중 중권 발전기의 유기기전력 관계식에서 기전력이\nV일 때, 극수와 병렬회로수의 비  , 전도체수                                                 \n, 회전수rpm, 자속∅의 값이 알맞게 짝지어진\n\n것은?\n\n          \n                       rpm    ∅\n ①     1        60       2400       0.05\n\n ②     1        120      4800      0.025\n\n ③     2        30       1200        0.2\n\n ④     2        60       2400       0.05\n\n ⑤      2         120      4800      0.025","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.05 지역난방공사 (한국행동과학연구소)","originalId":"2025p2-e11-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e11-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":762},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e11-m26-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P089-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.07.05 지역난방공사 (한국행동과학연구소) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n                                \n과 의 병렬회로에서 역률이    일 때, 과 의      \n\n관계로 바르게 짝지어진 것은?\n\n\n①        ② \n③        ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.05 지역난방공사 (한국행동과학연구소)","originalId":"2025p2-e11-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e11-m27-q.webp","width":678,"height":454},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e11-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":947}],"responseType":"multi