-e11-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e11-m29-q.webp","width":696,"height":668},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e11-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1494}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P089-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.07.05 지역난방공사 (한국행동과학연구소) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n정격용량이 2400kVA이고, 주파수가 50Hz인 동기전\n\n동기의 동기속도와 극수가 바르게 짝지어진 것은?\n\n\n\n       동기속도         극수\n\n ①         800                 6\n\n ②         800                 12\n\n ③        1000                 6\n\n ④        1000                12\n\n ⑤        1200                 6","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.05 지역난방공사 (한국행동과학연구소)","originalId":"2025p2-e11-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e11-m30-q.webp","width":696,"height":544},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e11-m30-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1211}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P089-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.07.05 지역난방공사 (한국행동과학연구소) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n직류 분권 전동기의 단자전압이 77.8V, 토크가 5N･m,\n\n전기자전류가 5A , 전기자 저항이 3Ω일 때, 회전속도\n\nrpm은?\n\n\n① 500         ② 600\n\n③ 800         ④ 900\n\n⑤ 1000","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.05 지역난방공사 (한국행동과학연구소)","originalId":"2025p2-e11-m31","number":