":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.05 지역난방공사 (한국행동과학연구소)","originalId":"2025p2-e11-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e11-m33-q.webp","width":678,"height":533},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e11-m33-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P089-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"25.07.05 지역난방공사 (한국행동과학연구소) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n파형에 따른 실횻값, 평균값으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n(단, 은 전압의 최댓값이다.)\n\n\n\n             실횻값     평균값\n\n ①   구형파                 \n\n                            \n ②   구형반파                                \n                             \n ③   정현파                                \n\n                            \n ④   정현반파           \n\n                            \n ⑤   삼각파                                           ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.05 지역난방공사 (한국행동과학연구소)","originalId":"2025p2-e11-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e11-m34-q.webp","width":696,"height":783},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e11-m34-e1.webp","width":696,"height":786}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P089-S2-Q10","number":10,"question":"25.07.05 지역난방공사 (한국행동과학연구소) · 객관식 35번","searchText":" 35\n\n교류회로의 커패시터의 용량을 기존의 2배로 증가시키고\n\n전압의 변화율을 일정하게 하였을 때, 커패시터에 작용하\n\n는 전류는 몇 배가 되는가?\n\n①          ② \n③            ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.05 지역난방공사 (한국행동과학연구소)","originalId":"2025p2-e11-m35","number":35},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e11-m35-q.webp","width":696,"height":509},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e11-m35-e1.webp","width":696,"height":539}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P089-S2-Q11","number":11,"question":"25.07.05 지역난방공사 (한국행동과학연구소) · 객관식 36번","searchText":" 36\n\n다음 회로에서 부하의 소비전력W은?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 180         ② 270\n\n③ 320         ④ 360\n\n⑤ 450","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.05 지역난방공사 (한국행동과학연구소)","originalId":"2025p2-e11-m36","number":36},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e11-m36-q.webp","width":696,"height":591},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e11-m36-e1.webp","width":696,"height":558}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P089-S2-Q12","number":12,"question":"25.07.05 지역난방공사 (한국행동과학연구소) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\n전압이 ≦일 때 V, ≦일 때 V\n\n인 경우, 전압의 실횻값V은?\n\n①          ② \n③          ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.05 지역난방공사 (한국행동과학연구소)","ori